SUMMARY:2027 ARC/PLC signup opens (FSA)
DESCRIPTION:Signup opens at your county FSA (Farm Service Agency) office fo
 r the 2027 crop year. This is where you choose ARC or PLC\, the two progra
 ms that can pay when crop prices or revenue fall. It runs to Mar 15\, 2027
 .\nCompare ARC and PLC for your county: https://agsist.com/arc-plc\nSource
 : https://www.fsa.usda.gov/news-events/news/09-15-2026/usda-announces-2026
 -2027-enrollment-key-price-revenue-safety-net\nWhat the market priced in: 
