SUMMARY:2026 ARC/PLC signup deadline (FSA)
DESCRIPTION:Last day to sign 2026 ARC or PLC at your FSA office. Changing y
 our election is optional\, but every farm needs a signed 2026 enrollment c
 ontract. Miss Dec 11 and the farm keeps its 2025 choice but gets no 2026 p
 ayment.\nCompare ARC and PLC for your county: https://agsist.com/arc-plc\n
 Source: https://www.fsa.usda.gov/news-events/news/09-15-2026/usda-announce
 s-2026-2027-enrollment-key-price-revenue-safety-net\nWhat the market price
 d in: https://agsist.com/usda-calendar. Free morning Daily: https://agsist
 .com/daily?utm_source=ics
URL:https://agsist.com/arc-plc
